first_messages.content:
Hello,

I am deploying a nuxt app using supabase on vercel. I am all of a sudden randomly getting this error printed on my website. and sometimes it does work. Any idea what is going on?

Node.js 20 detected without native WebSocket support. Suggested solution: For Node.js < 22, install "ws" package and provide it via the transport option: import ws from "ws" new RealtimeClient(url, { transport: ws })

Claude suggested to add this plugin which fixed the issue 75% of the times, but sometimes the error still appears. 

```
import ws from 'ws'

export default defineNuxtPlugin(() => {
    if (!globalThis.WebSocket) {
        globalThis.WebSocket = ws as any
    }
})
```

Any idea? Help much appreciated
